      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i live in one of the new smart complexes in hudson yards and i think there’s something wrong with the hvac or the lighting ballasts. i’ve been noticing this weird low humming that’s almost impossible to hear but it’s like... vibrating in my chest. it’s super consistent with the lights flickering. can u help me figure out if these frequencies are actually within normal building specs or if they’re doing something weird with the modulation?",
